    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ST. AUGUSTINE, FLORIDA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"St. Augustine, Florida is a location where Middleton was held as a prisoner of war."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EDWARD RUTLEDGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Edward Rutledge is a person who was imprisoned with Middleton and Heyward Jr. in St. Augustine, Florida."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THOMAS HEYWARD JR.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Thomas Heyward Jr. is a person who was imprisoned with Middleton and Rutledge in St. Augustine, Florida."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MIDDLETON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Middleton is a person who was imprisoned as a prisoner of war and later died in 1787 or 1790."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HENRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Henry is the eldest son of Middleton who inherited the plantation after his father's death."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STATE GAZETTE OF SOUTH-CAROLINA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"State Gazette of South-Carolina is a newspaper that published death notices for Middleton."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SARA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sara is the wife of Arthur Middleton who inherited the plantation after her husband's death."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ARTHUR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Arthur is the son of Sarah and Arthur Middleton who inherited the plantation after his father's death."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE OAKS PLANTATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Oaks plantation is a plantation owned by Arthur Middleton that began making money in 1699."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAROLINA GENTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Carolina gentry refers to the social class in colonial South Carolina to which Arthur Middleton belonged."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LONDON COUNTY COUNCIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"London County Council is an organization where Arthur Edward Middleton served as a politician and alderman."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ISLINGTON NORTH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Islington North is a location where Arthur Edward Middleton represented on the council."&lt;SEP&gt;"Islington North is the location where Arthur Edward Middleton represented on the council."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROYAL COMMISSION ON THE PRESS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Royal Commission on the Press is an organization where Arthur Edward Middleton served on."&lt;SEP&gt;"Royal Commission on the Press is the organization where Arthur Edward Middleton served on."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MIDDLETON PLACE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Middleton Place is the family tomb where Middleton was buried."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1780&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1780 marks the year when Middleton was sent as a prisoner of war."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1787&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1787 is the year when Middleton died at the age of 44."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1790&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1790 is the year when Middleton died at the age of 47."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1685&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"1685 is the year when Arthur Middleton's father died, leaving the plantation to his wife and son."&lt;SEP&gt;"1685 is the year when Middleton's father died, leaving the plantation to his wife and son."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0424-54085d7b43ca</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;1699&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
